robust recycling programs, composting solutions, and detailed diversion reporting for accreditation requirements."},{"title":"Event & Move-Out Support","description":"Specialized services for high-volume periods like graduation ceremonies, sporting events, and end-of-semester move-outs when waste volumes spike dramatically."},{"title":"Compliance & Reporting","description":"Detailed documentation and reporting to meet state and federal environmental regulations, plus support for STARS sustainability ratings and other certifications."}],"faqs":[{"question":"How do you handle waste during move-in and move-out periods?","answer":"We provide additional containers and increased pickup frequency during high-volume periods like semester start/end, graduation, and major campus events. Our team works with your facilities department to pre-position resources and ensure quick turnaround."},{"question":"Can you help us improve our campus recycling rates?","answer":"Absolutely. We conduct waste audits to identify contamination issues and recycling opportunities, provide educational materials for students and staff, and implement best practices that have helped campuses increase diversion rates by 30% or more."},{"question":"Do you offer specialized containers for different campus areas?","answer":"Yes, we provide a range of container sizes and types appropriate for different campus environments - from compact bins for academic buildings to large compactors for dining facilities and roll-offs for construction projects."},{"question":"How does reporting work for sustainability certifications?","answer":"We provide detailed monthly and annual reports that align with common sustainability frameworks like AASHE STARS, including waste volumes, diversion rates, and environmental impact metrics that can be directly incorporated into your certification submissions."},{"question":"Can you coordinate with multiple campus departments?","answer":"Yes, we work with facilities, sustainability offices, housing, athletics, and events teams to ensure coordinated service delivery across your entire campus. You'll have a single point of contact who manages all relationships."}]}],["$L7","$L8","$L9"],"$La"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$Lb",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$c",[]],"S":true}
